* impedance of phase1 of left example
.meas AC Vab FIND V(a,b) AT 50
.meas AC Iab FIND Ix(U25:IN1) AT 50
.meas AC Zab PARAM ABS(Vab/Iab)


* impedance of phase2 of left example
.meas AC Vde FIND V(d,e) AT 50
.meas AC Ide FIND Ix(U25:IN2) AT 50
.meas AC Zde PARAM ABS(Vde/Ide)



* impedance of phase3 of left example
.meas AC Vgh FIND V(g) AT 50
.meas AC Igh FIND Ix(U25:IN3) AT 50
.meas AC Zgh PARAM ABS(Vgh/Igh)